      "retrieved": "2026-10-05",
      "fields": [
        "nsc_enrolled_fall"
      ],
      "notes": "COLLEGE_PctEnrolledCurrYr: the share of the prior year's four-year graduation cohort who earned a regular diploma and were enrolled in an in-state or out-of-state two- or four-year college in the fall right after graduating (\"Total Enrolled\" ÷ \"Total in the Class\" in the National Student Clearinghouse report; EOC Accountability Manual). \"N/AV\" and \"N/A\" are not reported."
    },
    {
